. * Phase 8: lowess, lrtest, hausman, xtsum, xtdescribe, xtpoisson, xtlogit,
. * qreg and putexcel
. clear

. set seed 804

. set obs 200
number of observations (_N) was 0, now 200

. gen id = ceil(_n/10)

. gen t = mod(_n-1, 10) + 1

. xtset id t
       panel variable:  id (strongly balanced)
        time variable:  t, 1 to 10
                delta:  1 unit

. gen x = round(runiform()*4, .01)

. gen u = (id - 10)/10

. gen yc = floor(exp(.2 + .3*x + u) * runiform()*2)

. gen yb = runiform() < invlogit(-1 + .6*x + u)

. gen y = 1 + 2*x + u + round(runiform(), .01)

. 
